{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"bull","model_identifier":"bull","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# bull\n\nBull (B4), 1.49 m at the withers (53 u).\n\nHeavier build than the cow: shoulder hump, thick neck, short horns, no udder. Same quadruped rig as the ox (jaw for chewing and mooing, two-bone tail with switch).\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.5..9.5, y -0.0..53.0, z -52.0..28.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 17 x 53 x 53 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -2.6, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | breathing, tail flicks |\n| `walk` | 1.2 | loop | 4-beat walk |\n| `run` | 0.56 | loop | gallop (flee) |\n| `charge` | 0.52 | loop | head down, horns forward, full gallop (defends itself when attacked) |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop | muzzle on the grass, chewing, odd front step (loop) |\n| `moo` | 2 | once | head lifts, mouth opens 0.8-1.4 s (the sound), back by 2.0 s |\n| `lie_down` | 2.4 | hold | front knees first, then hind; lies with legs folded and holds (play reversed to get up) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | falls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.0 m/s), cycle 1.2 s, 43 u per cycle\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.0 m/s), cycle 0.56 s, 100 u per cycle\n- `charge`: 213.3 u/s (6.0 m/s), cycle 0.52 s, 111 u per cycle\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `bull_black_white.png`: black and white patches\n- `bull_dun.png`: dun (pale tan, dark legs)\n- `bull_calf.png`: young texture (use at half scale): soft light red-brown, horns and udder painted as hide so they vanish visually\n\n## Notes\n\n- Default texture is red-brown. Patch textures share one UV layout.\n"},"description":"# bull\n\nBull (B4), 1.49 m at the withers (53 u).\n\nHeavier build than the cow: shoulder hump, thick neck, short horns, no udder. Same quadruped rig as the ox (jaw for chewing and mooing, two-bone tail with switch).\n\n- Cubes: 29 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 128x128, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -9.5..9.5, y -0.0..53.0, z -52.0..28.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- body box 17 x 53 x 53 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = -2.6, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop | breathing, tail flicks |\n| `walk` | 1.2 | loop | 4-beat walk |\n| `run` | 0.56 | loop | gallop (flee) |\n| `charge` | 0.52 | loop | head down, horns forward, full gallop (defends itself when attacked) |\n| `graze` | 4.5 | loop | muzzle on the grass, chewing, odd front step (loop) |\n| `moo` | 2 | once | head lifts, mouth opens 0.8-1.4 s (the sound), back by 2.0 s |\n| `lie_down` | 2.4 | hold | front knees first, then hind; lies with legs folded and holds (play reversed to get up) |\n| `injured` | 0.6 | once | flinch back |\n| `death` | 1.6 | hold | falls onto its right side, holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 35.6 u/s (1.0 m/s), cycle 1.2 s, 43 u per cycle\n- `run`: 177.8 u/s (5.0 m/s), cycle 0.56 s, 100 u per cycle\n- `charge`: 213.3 u/s (6.0 m/s), cycle 0.52 s, 111 u per cycle\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n\n## Variant textures (same UV layout)\n\n- `bull_black_white.png`: black and white patches\n- `bull_dun.png`: dun (pale tan, dark legs)\n- `bull_calf.png`: young texture (use at half scale): soft light red-brown, horns and udder painted as hide so they vanish visually\n\n## Notes\n\n- Default texture is red-brown. Patch textures share one UV layout.\n","resolution":{"wi